 "content": [
  {
   "signature": "",
   "thinking": "",
   "type": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "text": "{\"recommendation\":\"escalate\",\"explanation\":\"The Total Leverage Ratio for the period ended September 30, 2026 tests at {{fact:71f1f463-4257-42f8-a87e-3caed6a4e61c}} against a maximum of {{fact:46ed2531-fbc9-49f8-bd24-8efba7c42b63}}, while the certificate reports {{fact:ec15fc1e-2bdd-4b2e-9347-dfc5042bdd4d}} and compliance. In Schedule 1 of the certificate, the borrower's Total Debt and EBITDA components match the bank's inputs. The gap comes from one line the borrower added to EBITDA: pro forma cost savings from plant consolidation. The Credit Agreement's EBITDA definition (Section 1.1) allows only interest expense, income tax expense, and depreciation and amortization to be added back. It has no provision for pro forma cost savings. No amendments or other terms versions are on file. Rerunning the test under the approved terms (version 1) confirms the failure. The breach appears real, and the certificate's compliance statement rests on an add-back the agreement does not permit.\",\"claims\":[{\"text\":\"The borrower's covenant calculation adds pro forma cost savings from plant consolidation to EBITDA.\",\"document_id\":\"cbba0e3e-267e-49ff-9c3d-98c981dd2bff\",\"page\":2,\"quote\":\"Pro forma cost savings from plant consolidation\"},{\"text\":\"The certificate's leverage ratio uses an adjusted EBITDA figure the borrower calculated itself.\",\"document_id\":\"cbba0e3e-267e-49ff-9c3d-98c981dd2bff\",\"page\":2,\"quote\":\"EBITDA as calculated by the Borrower\"},{\"text\":\"The Credit Agreement defines EBITDA as net income plus specified items deducted in determining net income.\",\"document_id\":\"5619124a-a597-45bf-b083-b81126509ae2\",\"page\":4,\"quote\":\"\\\"EBITDA\\\" means, for any period, net income of the Borrower for such period plus, to the extent\"},{\"text\":\"The permitted add-backs are limited to interest, income tax, and depreciation and amortization; no cost-savings add-back is listed.\",\"document_id\":\"5619124a-a597-45bf-b083-b81126509ae2\",\"page\":4,\"quote\":\"deducted in determining net income for such period, interest expense, income tax expense, and\"},{\"text\":\"Section 6.1 sets the maximum Total Leverage Ratio, tested quarterly.\",\"document_id\":\"5619124a-a597-45bf-b083-b81126509ae2\",\"page\":7,\"quote\":\"6.1 Total Leverage Ratio. The Borrower shall not permit the Total Leverage Ratio, measured as of\"}],\"calc_ids\":[\"99eeceb9-29fb-4de5-b615-ca46e2a2e792\"],\"missing_evidence\":[],\"suggested_tag\":\"borrower_calc_error\"}",
   "type": "text"
  }
 ],
